!Name: var760
!C The lowest period (760) of a family of adjustable 2c/5 puffers.
!C Delaying the forward glider turn by 16 generations increases the period
!C by 50. Delaying the backward glider turn by 12 generations increases the
!C period by 60. All multiples of 10 from 960 upwards can be achieved.
!Source: 2c5puff
